# Netlify: any /e/:slug path must serve the SPA's index.html so React
# can read the slug from window.location.pathname and render the right
# event. Without this, directly opening a QR link (not navigating via
# in-app JS) 404s because Netlify has no server-side route for /e/*.
#
# Place this file at the project root as `public/_redirects` (Vite copies
# everything in `public/` to the build output as-is).

/e/*  /index.html  200
